#. module: bf_irregularity_project
#: model:bf.irregularity.detector,description:bf_irregularity_project.detector_task_waiting_too_long
msgid ""
"A task in “Waiting – Client” or “Waiting – External” for longer than the "
"threshold: the wait has no end date, so nobody is reminded."
msgstr ""
"Tâche en « Attente - Client » ou « Attente - Externe » depuis plus longtemps"
" que le seuil : l'attente n'a pas d'échéance, donc personne n'est relancé."

#. module: bf_irregularity_project
#: model:bf.irregularity.detector,description:bf_irregularity_project.detector_task_in_archived_project
msgid ""
"A task that is still open although its project is archived: it no longer "
"shows up anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Tâche encore ouverte alors que son projet est archivé : elle n'apparaît plus"
" nulle part."

#. module: bf_irregularity_project
#: model:bf.irregularity.detector,description:bf_irregularity_project.detector_timesheet_missing_day
msgid ""
"A working day, according to the employee's calendar, on which no time was "
"logged on any project."
msgstr ""
"Jour ouvré, selon le calendrier de l'employé, sans aucune saisie de temps "
"sur un projet."

#. module: bf_irregularity_project
#: model:bf.irregularity.detector,description:bf_irregularity_project.detector_task_unassigned
msgid "An open task in an active project with nobody assigned to it."
msgstr ""
"Tâche ouverte, dans un projet actif, à laquelle personne n'est assigné."

